column5:
change boundary condition for p_{00}

* instead of imposing p_{00} = 0 at the top, rather impose the mass conservation
of the density perturbation

Causal smoothing kernel option

def preprocess_groundtruth_artificial_noise_balanced(..., causal_kernel=0)

default = non-causal

Fix issue in Synopsys DC 2016.03

Synopsys DC 2016.03 didn't like the following constructs in
`axi_to_axi_lite.sv`, and generated an "Internal Error":

    typedef struct packed { ... } meta_rd_t;
    meta_rd_t meta_rd;
    assign slave.r_id = meta_rd.id;

Fix this with a hack, i.e. not using `meta_rd_t meta_rd`. Quite ugly.

